  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You call upon your dragonmark's power to enable swift travel. When you Cast the Spell, any time you make a check with the Move trait, or Piloting check on a land vehicle you gain a +1 status bonus to the skill or perception used for the roll. This bonus remains as long as you Sustain the Spell.</p>\n<hr />\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You do not need to sustain Swift Passage.</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The bonus increases to +2.</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The duration is 1 hour.</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (9th)</strong> The bonus increases to +3.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pathfinders-guide-to-eberron-compendium.eberron-effects.dp2lM015Bok7SU04]{Spell Effect: Courier's Skill}</p>"
    },
